Package: hintcontrol-gtk
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Tyler
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libgtk-4-1, libssl3 | libssl3t64
Description: GTK4 desktop app for managing T-Mobile Home Internet gateways
 HINTControl-gtk provides a Linux desktop interface for viewing gateway signal
 details, managing Wi-Fi settings, and controlling gateway sessions.
